			<div class="content" id="post-content-3562198">
									

<p>Note that the reason the I placed the time frame far back was to suggest the presence of far past civilizations (described to an extent in the documents (Erliontipa and Olute)), which were probably anomalous in some ways. I also wanted to keep some consistency with <a href="/scp-1726">SCP-1726</a>, which describes the Daevite Empire collapsing prior to 9000 BCE.</p>
